OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785745097
OL,3,CCause of death of missing Farnborough
OL,4,Cwoman 'inconclusive'
OL,6,FInspector Mike Hall, the Inspector for
OL,7,Fthe Rushmoor district, said: "We know
OL,8,Fthis incident will have caused concern
OL,9,Fin the local community, but I would
OL,10,Flike to reassure that we are doing all
OL,11,Fwe can to find out how Janna died.
OL,13,F"Our officers continue to work round
OL,14,Fthe clock to establish the exact
OL,15,Fcircumstances of what has happened. We
OL,16,Fwill remain in the area for some time
OL,17,Fas we continue to gather evidence and
OL,18,Fcarry out enquiries.
OL,20,FIf you have any questions or concerns,
OL,21,Fplease speak to a uniformed officer."
